{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"user","type":"text","text":"👤 **Human User**\n\n**工作方式：**\n- ✍️ 使用 Obsidian 写作\n- 🛡️ 管理 Cabinet\n- 📐 设计 System\n\n**AI 是内阁辅助系统**","x":280,"y":60,"width":320,"height":371,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cabinet","type":"text","text":"🌿 **CABINET**\n**用户知识库**\n\n**内容：**\n- 📂 project\n- 🧠 knowledge\n- 🔍 research\n- 📝 daily notes\n\n**特点：**\n- **Human Only**\n- AI 默认只读\n- 个人私有思考空间","x":-440,"y":-360,"width":320,"height":390,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"runtime","type":"text","text":"⚙️ **RUNTIME**\n**AI 工作层**\n\n**内容：**\n- 🗂️ cards/\n- ⚖️ audits/\n- 🧬 embeddings/\n- 🧠 agent memory\n\n**特点：**\n- **AI 可写**\n- 物理分离、自动生成","x":-440,"y":-900,"width":320,"height":400,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"mirrorcore","type":"text","text":"💎 **Mirror Core**\n**AI Agent Runtime**\n\n**能力：**\n- 🧠 Memory Orchestration\n- 🎓 Knowledge Synthesis\n- 🤖 Personal Agent\n- 接口层 (Interface)","x":280,"y":-900,"width":320,"height":400,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"tools","type":"text","text":"🔧 **TOOLS**\n**基础设施层**\n\n**内容：**\n- 🐳 docker (Dify/n8n)\n- 🔌 API / OneAPI\n- 🖥️ Local 3090\n- 🐍 scripts\n\n**特点：**\n- 系统运行环境\n- AI 调用工具链","x":280,"y":-1480,"width":320,"height":390,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"system","type":"text","text":"⚖️ **SYSTEM**\n**系统治理层**\n\n**内容：**\n- 📜 AI-OB Constitution\n- 🤖 Cursor Rules\n- 🏗️ Architecture Blueprint\n- 🛡️ Agent Policy\n\n**特点：**\n- **人类主导修改**\n- AI 仅提供提案","x":1020,"y":-900,"width":320,"height":390,"color":"1"}
